  m_text: 'Malwick Brickworks Employees,



    The manual override for the depot''s
    interior roller door has failed during last week''s power outage and has been
    disassembled for maintenance, and as such will be out of action until further
    notice. To prepare for a similiar power outage incident a fallback generator
    is being uninstalled underneith the head office location. In the time being,
    if there''s an emergency requiring the roller door to be opened without power,
    please immediately contact safety officer Michael Plough.


    Signed Michael
    Plough '
